{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06499","headline":"采菱词 · 储光羲","name":"采菱词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浊水菱叶肥，清水菱叶鲜。\n义不游浊水，志士多苦言。\n潮没具区薮，潦深云梦田。\n朝随北风去，暮逐南风旋。\n浦口多渔家，相与邀我船。\n饭稻以终日，羹蓴将永年。\n方冬水物穷，又欲休山樊。\n尽室相随从，所贵无忧患。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06499.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06499","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}